{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve the existing plugin ordering contract.** Released configurations document that plugins run in registration order, but this reverses every invocation-end hook. Existing plugins may therefore observe later plugins\u2019 MDC, tracing scopes, or shared resources already torn down after a patch upgrade. Keep registration order, or introduce an explicit opt-in/versioned LIFO contract and add a compatibility test for existing plugins.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77xzbr","finding_digest":"6a6a364423079980f182e8d5380ffe41cbf54169c4fd16e9b84450553a2a3bdc","finding_id":"arf_v1_njvdmrbda6myb4mc5dktqd76ih","finding_key":"sdk/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":110,"observation_digest":"77a8207684a96ee165ae3da23dbb3c6a28f32651a13884c49b6f23f8d3d56b18","observation_id":"aro_v1_o6uca5uevfxocznohwrd3oz4ni","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-08T21:06:50Z","review_id":"arr_v1_e4ji4x6vtjringgtj3lklewnz3","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"80110fc612416cc3162cb3c4a85f8439212aa8d8","reviewer":"codex","start_line":110,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":771},"record_id":"art_v1_qn2zqd5swxqpvr7d5a2lpcuqix","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T21:06:50Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
